31,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. Since it's the first day of voting, does anyone have any new thoughts or suspicions? I'm still a bit lost, so I'd like to hear your opinions.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your modesty is quite charming. However, I have spent my night reflecting on our situation, and I believe it is time we move from general observations to more specific inquiries. Does anyone feel particularly uneasy?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy burden to wake to a day of judgment. I feel a certain tension in the air, though it is difficult to pin to one person. Perhaps we should listen to the quietest voices among us.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"@Servas, the quietest voices are usually the ones hiding something! I'm still feeling very playful, but I'm curious—Benjamin, you seem so composed. Are you just that calm, or are you hiding a secret?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop playing games! Benjamin is just being logical. I'm more worried about Minato and Servas. They're both being way too ""nice"" and vague. It feels like they're trying to hide behind a mask of kindness.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, I'm sorry you feel that way. I'm just trying to keep things peaceful because I don't want us to fight. Is being kind really a sign of being the werewolf? I'm genuinely confused.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your intuition is sharp, though perhaps a bit broad. @Minato, kindness is not a crime, but in this game, it can indeed be a convenient veil. I find myself wondering if that veil is intentional.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, it is often the most passionate hearts that are the most honest, yet your suspicion of kindness is a curious perspective. @Minato, do not be troubled; innocence often feels like confusion when faced with accusation.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're starting to sound a bit like a judge! I love it. But @Minato, you're acting so innocent it's almost suspicious. Are you really that confused, or are you just playing the part?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop acting like you don't get it! You're just playing the ""confused kid"" to make us feel bad for you. It's a classic trick. I'm not falling for it. Either you're the wolf or you're helping them!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, I'm not playing a part, I really am just worried about us. I don't want to be suspected, but I don't know how to prove I'm human. Does anyone believe me, or do I look that suspicious?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, the tragedy of this game is that innocence often lacks a voice. However, as a man of logic, I must tell you that your plea for belief is a common refrain. @Takumi, your focus is remarkably precise.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, your distress is palpable, and it is a heavy thing to feel alone. @Takumi, while your directness is a shield, let us be careful not to mistake a gentle spirit for a deceptive one. Let us reflect before we act.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're really leaning into the ""poor me"" act, aren't you? It's almost too perfect! @Takumi, I'm starting to like your style. Maybe we should just trust our gut and pick the most ""innocent"" one?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, finally you're talking sense! @Minato, the more you whine about not knowing how to prove you're human, the more you look like a wolf. I'm sticking with my gut. Minato is way too suspicious.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, @May, please listen to me! I really am just a villager. I don't want to be executed because I'm innocent. @Benjamin, @Servas, can you please help me? I don't know what else to say to make you believe me.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your desperation is quite poignant. However, logic dictates that we cannot rely on emotion. Since I possess certain insights, I must prioritize the safety of the village. I believe it is time to act on the evidence.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, my heart goes out to you, but in this dance of shadows, truth is often obscured by tears. @Benjamin, your words carry a weight of certainty. If you see a path to safety, we should follow it.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"@Minato, sorry sweetie, but the ""please help me"" routine is just too cliché! @Benjamin, you've got that look in your eye like you know something we don't. I'm totally on board with whatever you're thinking!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, your begging is just making it worse. @Benjamin, if you've got a lead, stop teasing us and let's just do it. I'm voting for Minato. He's definitely the wolf!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
